A python based computer game

Run Platstart.py with Python and pygame installed.
Move with arrow keys or A/D, and jump with Space, Up, or W.
Collect all four coins while avoiding the purple enemy chasing you.
The enemy jumps when you are above it or a platform blocks its path.
Enemy movement AI is in enemyai.py. Touching the enemy or falling off-screen
respawns you, removes all collected coins, and restores the coins to the level.